Subject: [PATCH 72/73] Freeciv45: the production chooser is a list in sections

With the Freeciv45 layout on, the chooser that the city dialog, the city
overlay and the map's quick-select open is one column instead of a
three-column grid: the city's name, then Units, Buildings, Great Wonders,
Small Wonders and the rest (Coinage), each under a heading that cannot be
picked, then Cancel. Each row has the picture, the name and how many
turns it takes. The grid stays for the other layout. Issue 374.
